<title>UK: Lockheed, Northrop in link up on early warning jet.</title>
<headline>Lockheed, Northrop in link up on early warning jet.</headline>
<dateline>FARNBOROUGH, England 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. defence to aerospace giant Lockheed Martin Corp announced on Tuesday a link up with Northrop Grumman Corp to target business in the international airborne early warning aircraft market.</p>
<p>Lockheed said both firms had signed a memorandum of understanding to market a version of its C-130J Hercules aircraft fitted with an early warning system.</p>
</text>
